  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">R2HC Research for Health in Humanitarian Crises - Effectiveness and Coverage of SAM Treatment by CHWs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to obtain evidence on the following research question:  

Can Community Health Workers (CHWs) obtain equal or higher severe acute malnutrition (SAM) cure rates and increase treatment coverage by using a simplified/combined protocol compared to using the current Community Management of Acute Malnutrition (CMAM) protocol?</narrative>
  </description>
